OL,3,GNEWSACouncil axes #50 school uniform
OL,4,Avoucher scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has scrapped plans to give
OL,7,Fevery family in a Merseyside borough a
OL,8,F#50 voucher towards the cost of school
OL,9,Funiforms.
OL,11,FAs the new school year gets under way,
OL,12,FSt Helens Council leader George
OL,13,FWoodward said the Reform UK-led
OL,14,Fauthority was pulling the scheme, which
OL,15,Fwas announced earlier this year by the
OL,16,Fprevious Labour administration.
OL,18,FIn a post on the council's website, he
OL,19,Fsaid the offering was among several
OL,20,Finitiatives "not being taken forward"
OL,21,Fin a bid to save the council #2
OL,22,Fmillion.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
